imud-prometheus (1.6.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New http_enabled key gates the /metrics listener. The stock config
    ships the daemon enabled with the output off.
  * Fix: enabled = false no longer crash-loops under systemd (Type=notify)
    — the bridge signals readiness before exiting cleanly.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Mon, 20 Jul 2026 12:00:00 -0700

imud-prometheus (1.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The temperature gauge now reports the real IMU die temperature (the
    daemon previously always published a 25.0 degC placeholder).

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Wed, 15 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0700

imud-prometheus (1.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: Prometheus /metrics exporter over imud's stream socket.
    Gauges in base SI units (attitude, heading, heave, sea state, fusion and
    compass-health diagnostics, flag bits), imud_up + imud_packets_total.
    First bridge built purely on libimud's ABI-stable imud_data_t — no wire
    pinning. Runtime dependency: libimud.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Sat, 11 Jul 2026 11:36:06 -0700
